    "text": "tchdailynews.com\nwebsite\nBonduel\nTuesday Prep Scoreboard: Seymour Girls Golf Stays Hot; Tennis Duals Go to Hortonville, New London, Menasha\nBy Evan Christman,\n13 hours agoThe Wittenberg-Birnamwood Chargers girls cross country team captured 1st place at the Bonduel Bear Invite. The Chargers were led by a 3 Top-10 finishes from Rory Salvesen, Nora Bushman and Harper Krull. Mariah Wondra from Bonduel was the 1st place finisher. Girls Results:. WITTENBERG-BIRNAMWOOD 42, BONDUEL 66, LENA/ST. THOMAS ACADEMY...",
